within Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.B_BloodAndBloodFormingOrgans.B01A_AntithromboticAgents.B01AE07_DabigatranEtexilate;
model DabigatranEtexilate_Liesenfeld2006_PD_ect
  "linear exposure-response sweep — Liesenfeld_2006 :: ECT (ecarin clotting time)"
  extends Pharmacolibrary.Interfaces.PartialExposureResponseSweep(
    E0 = 28,      // [s; s × 1]
    Emax = 0, EC50 = 1,      // unused by a line
    exposure_per_s = 1e-06);
  parameter Real slope = 380000   "[meter ** 3 * second / kilogram; s ng(-1) ml(-1) × 1e+06]";
equation
  response = E0 + slope*exposure;
  annotation(experiment(StartTime = 0, StopTime = 1000, Interval = 2),
    Documentation(info = "<html><body><h4>DabigatranEtexilate_Liesenfeld2006_PD_ect</h4><p>The steady-state exposure-response curve of Liesenfeld KH et al., <i>British journal of clinical pharmacology 62(5):527–537</i> 2006 (<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1365-2125.2006.02667.x\">doi:10.1111/j.1365-2125.2006.02667.x</a>) — ecarin clotting time [s] against dabigatran ng ml(-1) — obtained by sweeping the driver instead of simulating a dose. Model family: linear.</p><h4>The parameters, in the paper's terms</h4><pre>  E0    =         28 s        drug-free response (baseline) (baseline ECT, Q324)
  slope =       0.38 s ng(-1) ml(-1) change in response per unit of exposure (SLOP, Q335)</pre><p>The algebra is <code>response = E0 + slope*exposure</code>; this model only supplies the numbers. The x axis is one ng ml(-1) of dabigatran per second of simulated time (exposure is in kg/m3): there is no state, no dose and no kinetics — plot <code>response</code> against <code>exposure</code> (or <code>time</code>).</p><h4>What it reproduces</h4><pre>  exposure = 0         response 28   (drug-free)</pre></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>11/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from Liesenfeld_2006: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: curated candidate</li></ul></body></html>"));
end DabigatranEtexilate_Liesenfeld2006_PD_ect;
